  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">STRATEGIC INITIATIVE FOR WOMEN IN THE HORN OF AFRI 2024 GRANT</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This third phase of the project aims to create a collaborative platform for solidarity, reflection, and action for grassroots women peace activists from Somalia (i.e. Somaliland, Puntland, and South-Central Somalia) and Sudan (Kassala and other locations TBC due to war). It aims to build on networks formed during the first two phases of the project, and deepen engagement as the contexts in Somalia and Sudan become increasingly fragile. This phase of the project will focus on a cascading approach to broaden the networks as well as meso and macro level advocacy to ensure that perspectives of these networks are integrated in both policy and practice in relation to inclusive governance and peace building</narrative>
  </description>
